    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12394" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dēbĭtĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		debeo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an owing, indebtedness</i> (extremely rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pecuniae et gratiae,</span>”
