					Planc. 28, 68</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Gell. 1, 4, 2 sq.</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torquetur debitione dotis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 14, 13, 5</span></i>
			.—<b>Transf.</b>, <i>the debt</i>, Ambros. de Tobia, 7, 25.</div>
